Pre-trained microWakeWord models (okay_nabu, hey_jarvis, hey_mycroft), copied from the Home Assistant
Android app (Apache License 2.0), which takes them from
https://github.com/esphome/micro-wake-word-models (Apache License 2.0, covering the model weights).
They are English test models; the product wake phrase "Привет, Петя" needs its own model.
